<title>USA: Bristol, Conn., won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Bristol, Conn., won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc. said it won $4.260 million of Bristol, Conn., general obligation bonds, Issue of 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.34 percent.</p>
</text>
